description:
Building Safer Communities LLC provides prevention, intervention, education and training services. Services include: Education and Sports Basketball Team; Recovery Coaching;
Recovery Coach Training; Parenting Workshops; NYS Impaired Driving (drugs & alcohol) classes;
Domestic Violence classes; Anger Management classes;
Work Place Bullying workshops; Offender Workforce Development (OWD); Interactive Journaling;
Supportive Services for individuals, families and couples;
Adverse Childhood Experiences (ACE's) Training; Live Internet Radio Shows (community involvement).

Burrell Law, P.C. provides legal services for: *Business entity, special purpose vehicle (SPV) or other organization formation and structuring;
*Early-stage (seed) funding agreements and operational financing; *Contract drafting and negotiation (such as term sheets and agreements for convertible notes, preferred stock and other equity & debt issuances);
*Private placement offering memoranda (PPM);
*Reverse mergers, asset sales and other mergers and acquisitions;
*1993 Securities Act & 1934 Exchange Act legal advisory, including, disclosure counsel;
*Bond counsel;
*Virtual currency, cryptocurrency and other crypto-assets legal advisory;
*Renewable energy industry agreements (Power Purchase Agreements); and, *Domestic and international corporate tax advisory.

Dedicated to promoting African-centered holistic principles and providing a sacred support system, as a learning institute, where we advocate holistic alternatives; with a special focus on the health care needs of people of color. We promote holistic lifestyle modalities that honor the whole person (mind, body, spirit) and encourage people to actively participate in their own health & wellness. We are a support group for holistic health practitioners;
We offer continuing education to the holistic health community;
We are a holistic educational resource to the community at large;
We connect holistic health practitioners to the community in need of service;
We bring holistic health services to the community via various events and festivals;
We staff health & wellness for private, nonprofits, community and governmental events
